: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Make the number using counters or pieces of pasta.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Divide the counters into two equal piles.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Count one group to find half.</span>&nbsp;</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 705, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "DICE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 538, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, 16, 18]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]